      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 66: 🔴 `chmod -R a+rwX` makes the Rust toolchain and Cargo binaries world-writable while `/usr/local/cargo/bin` is prepended to PATH. Any build step running as the unprivileged user can modify executables used later, which is a privilege/supply-chain risk. Keep installed binaries read-only and grant write access only to the specific cache directories needed, preferably via ownership/group permissions for the build user.",
